      "id": "claim_b15a30212e724bd896b0bb7d979ca255",
      "statement": "Regardless of size, approval is required for an ordinary out-of-band weight, a position barred by a binding underweight sector limit, a concentrated-position hedge, municipal duration beyond the applicable band, and every private-markets commitment.",
