      "statement": "When a cited research note is superseded or withdrawn, the manager must suspend the dependent weight, escalate to the Committee rather than re-derive it, and may neither carry the prior weight forward nor directly adopt a replacement recommendation; the escalation records the old note, replacement if any, dependent weights, and affected accounts.",
